option.STYLE_SELECTION=Visual Theme
value.STYLE_SELECTION.0=§2Guofeng Ink
value.STYLE_SELECTION.1=§bXianxia Mist
option.STYLE_SELECTION.comment=Switches the overall artistic color theme between §2Guofeng Ink§r (Qinglü Shanshui mineral-pigment wash on warm Xuan paper) and §bXianxia Mist§r (cinematic azure skies, jade foliage & luminous sea of clouds).

option.SKY_STYLE=Shader Style
value.SKY_STYLE.0=§eWuxia Smooth
value.SKY_STYLE.1=§aMinecraft Voxel
option.SKY_STYLE.comment=Master style toggle across the shader pack: switches Clouds, Night Aurora, and Water together between §eWuxia Smooth§r (smooth volumetric clouds, silk auroras & pure 3D wave water) and §aMinecraft Voxel§r (3D blocky clouds, voxel auroras & pixel-textured voxel water).

option.CLOUD_TYPE=Cloud Theme
value.CLOUD_TYPE.0=Auto (By Theme)
value.CLOUD_TYPE.1=Guofeng Shanshui
value.CLOUD_TYPE.2=Xianxia Cumulus
value.CLOUD_TYPE.3=Off
option.CLOUD_TYPE.comment=Selects the artistic palette and formation character of the cloud layer (or turns shader clouds Off).

option.NIGHT_AURORA=Night Aurora
value.NIGHT_AURORA.0=Auto (By Theme & Style)
value.NIGHT_AURORA.1=Xianxia Celestial
value.NIGHT_AURORA.2=Guofeng Jade Silk
value.NIGHT_AURORA.3=Off
option.NIGHT_AURORA.comment=Automatically uses your Visual Theme (Guofeng Jade Silk or Xianxia Celestial) and your Shader Style (Wuxia Smooth ribbon or Minecraft Voxel pillars).

option.INK_OUTLINES=Outlines
value.INK_OUTLINES.0=Auto (By Theme)
value.INK_OUTLINES.1=Subtle
value.INK_OUTLINES.2=Shanshui
value.INK_OUTLINES.3=Off
option.INK_OUTLINES.comment=Camera-invariant interior silhouette brush outlines on foreground solid geometry.

option.LICENSE_INFO=About / License
value.LICENSE_INFO.0=§aGPL-3.0 Shader & Art
option.LICENSE_INFO.comment=§aGPL-3.0-only: original shader code and textures.§r §7Reuse, modify, and redistribute under GPLv3. Keep YunMeng contributor credits and third-party notices. See LICENSE.txt.§r

option.FOG_DENSITY=Mist Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the thickness of distant atmospheric mist and the Valley Sea of Clouds.

option.LIGHT_SHAFTS=Light Shafts
value.LIGHT_SHAFTS.0=Off
value.LIGHT_SHAFTS.1=Soft
value.LIGHT_SHAFTS.2=Full
option.LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Sunlight and moonlight shafts in mist and underwater. Soft gives gentler, shorter beams; Full gives stronger beams. Atmospheric Shaft Quality controls detail in air.
option.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_QUALITY=Atmospheric Shaft Quality
value.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_QUALITY.0=Low
value.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_QUALITY.1=Medium
value.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_QUALITY.2=High
value.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_QUALITY.3=Ultra
option.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_QUALITY.comment=Balances atmospheric beam detail and performance. Higher settings resolve narrow openings more cleanly. Does not change beam strength, mist density, or underwater sampling.
option.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_STRENGTH=Atmospheric Shaft Strength
option.ATMOSPHERIC_SHAFT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts sunlight and moonlight beams in air. Does not change underwater shafts or general mist density. Direct light must reach the opening.

option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Reflections
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.0=Sky Only
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.1=Fast SSR
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.2=Full SSR
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky Only reflects the atmosphere without clouds or objects. Fast and Full add reflected volumetric clouds and screen-space objects; Full uses more samples. Off-screen objects cannot be reflected.

option.BIOME_TINT_STRENGTH=Biome Atmosphere Tint
option.SUN_SIZE=Sun & Moon Size
option.SUN_LENS_FLARE=Sun Lens Flare
value.SUN_LENS_FLARE.0=Off
value.SUN_LENS_FLARE.1=Soft
value.SUN_LENS_FLARE.2=Full
option.SUN_LENS_FLARE.comment=Two thin, view-dependent rainbow arcs and two matching lens ghosts around a visible sun. Fades near screen edges, behind terrain, and in rain.
option.SEA_OF_CLOUDS_ALTITUDE=Mist Altitude
option.SEA_OF_CLOUDS_THICKNESS=Mist Height
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.WATER_WAVE_HEIGHT=Wave Height
option.CAUSTICS_STRENGTH=Caustics
option.WIND_SPEED=Wind Speed
option.WAVING_BAMBOO=Wave Bamboo
option.WAVING_SUGARCANE=Wave Reeds
option.WAVING_LEAVES=Wave Leaves
option.WAVING_GRASS=Wave Grass

option.CLOUD_QUALITY=Cloud Quality
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.0=Low
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.1=Medium
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.2=High
value.CLOUD_QUALITY.3=Ultra
option.CLOUD_QUALITY.comment=Balances cloud detail and rendering cost.
option.SHADOW_FILTER_QUALITY=Shadow Filtering
value.SHADOW_FILTER_QUALITY.0=Low
value.SHADOW_FILTER_QUALITY.1=Medium
value.SHADOW_FILTER_QUALITY.2=High
option.DYNAMIC_LIGHTING=Dynamic Lighting
value.DYNAMIC_LIGHTING.0=Off
value.DYNAMIC_LIGHTING.1=Simple
value.DYNAMIC_LIGHTING.2=Medium
value.DYNAMIC_LIGHTING.3=High
option.DYNAMIC_LIGHTING.comment=Hand-held torch and lantern illumination. Simple uses fast radial distance falloff; Medium adds directional surface-normal shading; High adds water specular glints and surface relief.

option.SUN_SIZE.comment=Scales the sun and moon together, including their artwork and rings.
option.BIOME_TINT_STRENGTH.comment=Controls biome-dependent atmosphere colors. Does not directly change block texture tint.
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Higher resolution sharpens shadow detail and uses more GPU memory.
option.shadowDistance.comment=Shadow rendering distance in blocks. Larger distances cost more and spread the shadow map over a wider area.
option.SHADOW_FILTER_QUALITY.comment=Controls shadow filtering samples. Higher settings soften edges at a higher rendering cost.
option.WIND_SPEED.comment=Shared animation speed for foliage and water waves.
option.WAVING_SUGARCANE.comment=Animates reeds and related mapped plants, including their shadows.
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Vignette Strength
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.comment=Screen-edge shading: silk tint in Guofeng, cinematic darkening in Xianxia, and underwater darkening. 0 disables; 1 retains the original look.
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure Adjustment
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Adjusts brightness before the existing tone curve. 0 retains the original look. This is manual artistic exposure, not automatic adaptation.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Adjusts color intensity relative to the selected visual theme. 1 retains its original colors.
option.PAINTERLY_WASH_STRENGTH=Painterly Wash
option.PAINTERLY_WASH_STRENGTH.comment=Guofeng only: blends nearby surface colors for a painted appearance. 0 disables; 1 retains the original wash.
option.PAPER_GRAIN_STRENGTH=Paper Grain
option.PAPER_GRAIN_STRENGTH.comment=Guofeng only: controls the fine paper texture. 0 disables; 1 retains the original texture.
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION_STRENGTH=Underwater Distortion
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the underwater screen ripple. 0 disables; 1 retains the original ripple. Does not change water fog or light rays.
value.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
value.PAINTERLY_WASH_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
value.PAPER_GRAIN_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
value.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION_STRENGTH.0.00=Off

option.ANTI_ALIASING=Anti-aliasing
value.ANTI_ALIASING.0=Off
value.ANTI_ALIASING.1=Subtle
value.ANTI_ALIASING.2=Smooth
value.ANTI_ALIASING.3=Temporal
option.ANTI_ALIASING.comment=Subtle gently cleans edges while keeping pixel detail crisp. Smooth gives stronger edge cleanup with texture-detail protection. Temporal combines frames to reduce moving shimmer, with possible softness or trails in motion.
option.MOTION_BLUR=Motion Blur
value.MOTION_BLUR.0=Off
value.MOTION_BLUR.1=Fast
value.MOTION_BLUR.2=Smooth
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Blurs camera and wind-animated foliage motion while protecting held items and depth edges. Smooth also estimates visible entity motion at higher rendering cost.
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH=Motion Blur Strength
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the shutter effect. 0 disables visible blur; switch Motion Blur to Off to skip the blur pass entirely.
value.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.0.00=Off


option.FLOW_FOAM_STRENGTH=Flow Foam
option.FLOW_FOAM_STRENGTH.comment=Restrained lacy foam on flowing slopes, thin flow tips and landing contacts. Still shorelines remain clear.
option.WATER_STYLE=Water Style
value.WATER_STYLE.0=Auto (By Shader Style)
value.WATER_STYLE.1=Wuxia Smooth
value.WATER_STYLE.2=Minecraft Voxel
option.WATER_STYLE.comment=Automatically follows your Shader Style. Wuxia Smooth renders pure 3D trochoidal waves with smooth caustics and foam; Minecraft Voxel enables the pixel water surface texture with 1/16-block pixel-locked waves, pixel caustics, and pixel flow foam.

option.WATER_TEXTURE=Surface Texture
option.WATER_TEXTURE.comment=Controls the resource pack or vanilla water surface texture visibility. Auto turns the surface texture Off in Wuxia Smooth and On (68%) in Minecraft Voxel.
value.WATER_TEXTURE.0.00=Auto
value.WATER_TEXTURE.0.25=Subtle
value.WATER_TEXTURE.0.50=Medium
value.WATER_TEXTURE.0.75=Strong
value.WATER_TEXTURE.1.00=Full

option.END_PORTAL_LAYERS=End Portal Depth
option.END_PORTAL_LAYERS.comment=Layered ink islands or celestial clouds inside End portals. More layers add depth and texture sampling.
value.END_PORTAL_LAYERS.2=Simple
value.END_PORTAL_LAYERS.3=Layered
value.END_PORTAL_LAYERS.4=Deep
screen.CLOUD_SETTINGS=Cloud Settings
option.CLOUD_SHAPE=Cloud Form
value.CLOUD_SHAPE.0=Auto (By Shader Style)
value.CLOUD_SHAPE.1=Soft Volumetric
value.CLOUD_SHAPE.2=Minecraft Voxel
value.CLOUD_SHAPE.3=Tall Volumetric
option.CLOUD_SHAPE.comment=Automatically follows your Shader Style (Wuxia Smooth -> Soft Volumetric; Minecraft Voxel -> sleek dual-layer 3D blocky clouds), or lets you override the cloud geometry manually.

option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud Coverage
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=Controls how much of the fair-weather sky is covered by clouds versus open clear-sky expanses. Rain and storms still form an overcast canopy.

option.CLOUD_DENSITY=Cloud Density
option.CLOUD_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the optical thickness and opacity of cloud formations and their cast ground/shaft shadows.

option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE=Cloud Altitude
option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE.comment=Sets the world Y base height of the cloud layer in blocks.

option.CLOUD_THICKNESS=Cloud Thickness
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS.comment=Sets the vertical thickness of the cloud layer in blocks. Lower values produce crisper, flatter cloud layers.

option.CLOUD_SCALE=Cloud Scale
option.CLOUD_SCALE.comment=Scales the horizontal size and spacing of cloud formations. Higher values spread clouds out into broader sheets with wider sky clearings.

option.CLOUD_SPEED=Cloud Speed
option.CLOUD_SPEED.comment=Controls how fast clouds drift across the sky. Set to 0.00 for stationary clouds.
value.CLOUD_SPEED.0.00=Stationary

option.CLOUD_RENDER_DISTANCE=Cloud Render Distance
option.CLOUD_RENDER_DISTANCE.comment=Maximum horizontal distance in blocks at which clouds are traced before fading into horizon mist. Lower values improve performance.

option.CLOUD_RAIN_COVERAGE=Rain & Storm Coverage
option.CLOUD_RAIN_COVERAGE.comment=Controls how much of the sky fills with clouds during rain and thunderstorms. Lower values keep more open sky breaks for the moon and stars; higher values form a heavier overcast canopy.

option.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE=Cloud Horizon Curve
option.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.comment=Curves the distant cloud dome downward toward the horizon so there is no flat gap between the ground and the bottom of distant clouds.
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.000=Flat (0.00)
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.030=Subtle (0.03)
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.050=Moderate (0.05)
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.065=Natural Dome (0.065)
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.080=Deep Dome (0.08)
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.100=Strong Wrap (0.10)
value.CLOUD_HORIZON_CURVE.0.120=Full Horizon Wrap (0.12)

option.END_GLYPH_STYLE=End Void Glyphs
value.END_GLYPH_STYLE.0=Auto (By Shader Style)
value.END_GLYPH_STYLE.1=§eClassical Chinese (太虛·歸墟)
value.END_GLYPH_STYLE.2=§aEnchanting Table (SGA)
value.END_GLYPH_STYLE.3=Off
option.END_GLYPH_STYLE.comment=Selects the astral glyphs rendered along The End's silk-scroll waves and voxel wave crests. Auto follows your Shader Style (Wuxia Smooth -> Classical Chinese brush calligraphy; Minecraft Voxel -> Standard Galactic Alphabet runes).

option.EMISSIVE_EYES_MODE=Glowing Eyes & Emissives
value.EMISSIVE_EYES_MODE.0=Off
value.EMISSIVE_EYES_MODE.1=Standard (Eyes + _e/_s)
value.EMISSIVE_EYES_MODE.2=§bAuto + Pack (Integrated)
option.EMISSIVE_EYES_MODE.comment=Controls glowing mob eyes and emissive textures. Standard enables vanilla eye layers (gbuffers_spidereyes), OptiFine/ETF _e.png overlays, and LabPBR _s.png maps. Auto + Pack also detects custom colored eyes and markings on dark-bodied mobs (such as Endermen and Spiders) in resource packs without _e or _s files.

option.EMISSIVE_BLOOM_STRENGTH=Eye Glow Bloom
value.EMISSIVE_BLOOM_STRENGTH.0.00=Off
option.EMISSIVE_BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the soft Gaussian bloom halo around glowing mob eyes and markings. 0 disables the outer halo while keeping the eyes bright; 1 retains the balanced default glow.
